       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L16.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TEXT PIC X(10) VALUE "  123.45 ".
       01 WS-NUMBER PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-DATE PIC X(21).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           COMPUTE WS-NUMBER = FUNCTION NUMVAL(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT))
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-DATE
           DISPLAY "NUMBER=" WS-NUMBER
           DISPLAY "DATE=" WS-DATE
           STOP RUN.
